+    //   * wrapping returns the exact value truncated to the bits type,
+    //   * overflowing returns (wrapped, overflow-flag),
+    //   * checked returns None exactly on overflow,
+    //   * saturating clamps exactly to MAX/MIN depending on the sign of the
